hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1498","Ibrahim bin Muhammad Al-Halabi Al-Basri told us strange news. He told us and he was trustworthy, and Abdullah bin Dawud used to praise him, Yahya bin Al-Harith Al-Shirazi, he said: Zuhair bin Muhammad Al-Tamimi told us, on the authority of Abu Hazim, on the authority of Sahl bin Saad Al-Saadi, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace May God bless him and grant him peace: “Those who walk to the mosques in the dark will receive the good news of perfect light on the Day of Resurrection.”"
"1499","Ibrahim bin Muhammad told us, Yahya bin Al-Harith told us, Abu Ghassan Al-Madani told us, on the authority of Abu Hazim, on the authority of Sahl bin Saad, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Tidings of perfect light to those who walk in darkness.”"
